@segment 24-26 Darkshore, Ashenvale I & Stonetalon
@start-level 24
# Human Warlock. From the Gnome route's segment 08 (class-neutral Alliance path): same quests, order, binds and
# flights. Changed: every combat hint is written for a warlock of level 24-26 (Voidwalker first, Corruption,
# Curse of Agony, Immolate, Fear on a second enemy, Drain Life, Health Funnel, Soulstone before the named
# fights; no interrupt, so casters and healers die first). Segment numbers in the texts are this route's (the
# Gnome's plus one). No travel changed. No training stop in this segment.
# First Kalimdor trip. Carried through untouched: 57, 67, 157, 181, 240, 453 (segment 11) and 275, 295, 471 (segment 10).
# Carry-out adds 1026 (Raene's Cleansing, the rod: segment 13).
# Hearth: Menethil Harbor until you bind in Astranaar.
# Left out on purpose: 731 and 908 (elite), 1199 / 1198 / 1275 / 1200 / 971 (Blackfathom Deeps), 1072 / 1075 / 1094 (they send
# you to Ironforge, Stormwind or Ratchet), 1057, and the quests kept for segment 13 (1035, 1011/1012, 1021/1031, 1022,
# 4581, 98417/98418, 86757, 1027-1046), the Darnassus hand-ins (1081, 741, 3765).
# The route's next training stop is Ironforge at 28.
@carry 57,67,157,161,181,240,275,295,453,471,97894

# ---------- Auberdine ----------
F Auberdine @ Darkshore, 36.3, 45.6 | Walk off the dock into Auberdine. Caylais Moonfeather, the hippogryph master, stands at the foot of the dock.
T 97894 @ Darkshore, 38.1, 41.2 | Gorbold Steelhand, at a merchant stall in Auberdine: the message from his brother in Stormwind
A 729 | Archaeologist Hollee, the dwarf in the north part of the village
A 965 | Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze, in the building on the east side of the village

# ---------- Tower of Althalaxx ----------
T 965 | Follow the road north out of Auberdine and turn east where the land rises toward the Tower of Althalaxx. Balthule Shadowstrike hides below the tower (55.0, 24.9).
A 966 | Balthule Shadowstrike
C 966 | Dark Strand Fanatics (16-17) camp around the tower: kill them for 4 Worn Parchments. They are far below you. Do not climb the tower: Athrikus Narassin (31) is at the top.
T 966 | Balthule Shadowstrike
A 967 | Balthule Shadowstrike. A letter for Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.

# ---------- South along the road ----------
T 729 | Run back past Auberdine and take the road south, a long way. Near the south end of Darkshore leave the road to the west: Prospector Remtravel stands in his dig (35.7, 83.7). Do not take his escort (elite).
A 945 | Therylune is in the Master's Glaive, the ruin just south-east of the dig (38.6, 87.3). Kill the cultists around her first.
C 945 @ Darkshore, 38.6, 87.3 | Escort: walk with Therylune until she is out of the Master's Glaive. Stay ahead of her and let the Voidwalker take what attacks; everything here is far below you.
A 5321 | Go north-east to the Grove of the Ancients, beside the road (44.4, 76.4). Kerlonian Evershade sleeps there.
C 5321 | Take the Horn of Awakening out of Kerlonian's Chest next to him, then escort Kerlonian south along the road. He follows you and keeps falling asleep: use the Horn of Awakening on him each time. Stay on the road and do not run ahead of him. Changed in Forever: the objective now reads "escort Kerlonian on the road south to his bag", still in Darkshore, so the escort part may end before Ashenvale. The hand-in is still listed at Maestra's Post.

# ---------- Maestra's Post ----------
T 5321 | Maestra's Post is the first camp on the road inside Ashenvale. Liladris Moonriver stands at its north end (27.3, 35.6).
T 967 | Delgren the Purifier, in the camp (26.2, 38.7)
A 970 | Delgren the Purifier
A 1010 | Orendil Broadleaf, next to him
C 970 @ Ashenvale, 31.3, 30.8 | The Dark Strand cultists dig in the ruins north-east of Maestra's Post (around 31, 31). Kill Cultists, Adepts, Excavators (18-20) and the Enforcer until one drops the Glowing Soul Gem.
C 1010 @ Ashenvale, 31.7, 23.0 | Bathran's Haunt is further north (around 32, 23). Pick 5 Bathran's Hair from the Plant Bundles on the ground between the Forsaken there (18-20).
T 1010 | Back at Maestra's Post: Orendil Broadleaf
A 1020 | Orendil Broadleaf. His cure goes to Astranaar.
T 970 | Delgren the Purifier
A 973 | Delgren the Purifier

# ---------- Shrine of Aessina and Fire Scar Shrine ----------
T 945 | Go south from Maestra's Post, across the road. Therysil stands at the Shrine of Aessina (22.6, 51.9).
C 973 | Fire Scar Shrine is just south of the Shrine of Aessina. Ilkrud Magthrull (24) stands in the middle of it (25.3, 60.7) with Felslayers (22-23) all around. Clear a path of Felslayers one at a time (they drain mana: kill them fast), then put a Soulstone on yourself and fight Ilkrud at full health and mana. He casts Shadow Bolts and a warlock has no interrupt: send the Voidwalker, put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on him and burn him down with Shadow Bolt; use Drain Life when your health drops and the Healthstone in an emergency. He can call a helper: Fear the helper and kill Ilkrud first unless the helper is nearly dead. He drops Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome. You hand it in when you pass Maestra's Post again.

# ---------- Astranaar ----------
F Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 34.4, 48.0 | Go back north to the road and follow it east to Astranaar, the town on the island in the lake. Daelyshia, the hippogryph master, stands at the west entrance.
S Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 37.0, 49.2 | Innkeeper Kimlya in the inn
A 1008 | Shindrell Swiftfire, near the west entrance
A 991 | Raene Wolfrunner, in the building in the middle of town
T 1020 | Pelturas Whitemoon, in the house at the south-east end of town
A 1033 | Pelturas Whitemoon

# ---------- Lake Falathim and the Zoram Strand ----------
T 991 | Take the road west out of Astranaar and leave it to the north-west for Lake Falathim. Teronis' Corpse lies at the lake (20.3, 42.3).
A 1023 | From Teronis' Corpse
C 1023 | Saltspittle murlocs (19-21) around the lake: kill them until one drops the Glowing Gem.
A 1007 | Keep north-west to the coast. Talen camps above the Zoram Strand (14.8, 31.3). The Horde has a camp on the shore south-west of him (Classic knowledge, not checked for Forever): stay away from its guards.
C 1007 | The Ancient Statuette lies on the strand north of Talen (14.2, 20.6). Fight your way there through the Wrathtail naga and count their heads.
T 1007 | Talen
A 1009 | Talen
C 1009,1008 @ Ashenvale, 9.0, 18.0 | Kill naga along the strand until you have 20 Wrathtail Heads: Wave Riders and Sorceresses (18-19) on the near side, Razortails and Sea Witches (19-20) further out, Myrmidons and Priestesses (20-21) at the north end. Ruuzel (22) stands with her guards on the small island at the north end (7.2, 13.1): send the Voidwalker at the guards one at a time from as far away as you can, then kill her for the Ring of Zoram. Sorceresses, Sea Witches and Priestesses are casters and some heal: a warlock has no interrupt, so kill them first with all three DoTs and Shadow Bolt while the Voidwalker holds the melee naga, or Fear a second caster where no other naga stand near. Lady Vespia, a rare elite who walks the strand, also carries the ring: leave her unless she is alone and you are at full health.
T 1009 | Talen

# ---------- Maestra's Post again ----------
T 973 | Walk back east to Maestra's Post: Delgren the Purifier
A 976 | Feero Ironhand, standing next to Delgren. This starts an escort with three ambushes.
C 976 @ Ashenvale, 26.2, 38.9 | Walk with Feero. Three groups attack one after the other, the last one the strongest. Eat and drink to full before you talk to him. In each ambush send the Voidwalker at the attackers so it holds them off Feero, and kill the casters first (you have no interrupt: DoT them and burn them down). You cannot heal Feero. Use Health Funnel on the Voidwalker and bandage or eat between waves if there is time; keep the Healthstone for the last wave. Feero fights too, but he must survive.
T 976 | Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post

# ---------- Astranaar hand-ins ----------
T 1008 | Back along the road to Astranaar: Shindrell Swiftfire
A 1134 | Shindrell Swiftfire. The wyverns are in Stonetalon, later in this segment.
T 1023 | Raene Wolfrunner
A 1024,1025,1054 | Raene Wolfrunner
A 1070 | Sentinel Thenysil, on the west side of town
A 1056 | Faldreas Goeth'Shael, near Raene's building

# ---------- North and east of Astranaar ----------
C 1054 | Thistlefur Village is in the hills north of Astranaar. Dal Bloodclaw (25) stands at 37.7, 34.7 among Thistlefur furbolgs (23-24), among them Thistlefur Shamans, who heal. Pull single furbolgs with the Voidwalker on the way in and kill the healers first (you cannot interrupt a heal: put all three DoTs on and burn them down). Fear a second furbolg only at the edge of the village: a feared one brings friends. Fight Dal at full health with nothing else near him: Soulstone on yourself, Voidwalker first, Drain Life when he turns on you. Loot his skull.
C 1033 | Come back down to the road and follow it east to Iris Lake, north of the road. Elune's Tear lies on the small island in the lake (46.4, 46.4): pick one up.
T 1024 | Shael'dryn stands at the moonwell further east, north of the road (53.5, 46.2)
A 1026 | Shael'dryn. Keep this one: the rod pieces are for the second Ashenvale trip (segment 13).
T 1054 | Back to Astranaar: Raene Wolfrunner
T 1033 | Pelturas Whitemoon
A 1034 | Pelturas Whitemoon

# ---------- South of Astranaar: Stardust, Silverwind Refuge ----------
C 1034 | Leave Astranaar and go south. The Ruins of Stardust are on the island in the lake south of town (33.3, 67.8): pick 5 Handfuls of Stardust from the Stardust Covered Bushes.
A 1016 | Go east along the south side of the zone, past the mouth of the Talondeep Path, to Silverwind Refuge on the shore of Mystral Lake. Sentinel Velene Starstrike is there (49.8, 67.2).
C 1016 @ Ashenvale, 49.0, 70.4 | Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) walk in and around Mystral Lake. Send the Voidwalker at one at a time and kill them for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then right-click the Divining Scroll she gave you to make the Divined Scroll.
T 1016 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
A 1017 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
C 1025 @ Ashenvale, 53.3, 62.0 | The Foulweald furbolgs live in Greenpaw Village, north-east of Silverwind Refuge (49-58, 60-65). Kill 1 Den Watcher, 2 Ursas (both 24-25, in the middle of the village), 10 Totemics and 12 Warriors (23-24). The Totemics heal and set down wards: kill them first (you cannot interrupt their heals: all three DoTs, then Shadow Bolt) and destroy the wards with your wand. Pull from the edge with the Voidwalker so you fight two at most; Fear the second one only when no other group is near.
C 1017 @ Ashenvale, 49.0, 70.4 | Sarilus Foulborne (25) stands on the island in the middle of Mystral Lake. Clear the elementals near the island, then fight him at full health and mana, with a Soulstone on yourself. He is a caster and you have no interrupt: send the Voidwalker, put Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate on him and burn him down; Drain Life keeps you up. If he has a summoned servant with him, let the Voidwalker hold it and kill Sarilus first. Loot his head. (Questie files him under a Barrens map position; the lake is where the quest sends you.)
T 1017 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
A 98027 | Only if you are level 25, otherwise press Skip here and on its hand-in. A Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies on the ground east of Mystral Lake (63.0, 71.5): clicking it starts a level 29 quest (new in Forever). The woods out there are above your level: run in, take the pendant and leave.

# ---------- Talondeep Path -> Windshear Crag ----------
T 1070 | Go back west to the Talondeep Path, the tunnel in the southern cliffs (entrance at Ashenvale 42.3, 71.0), and run through it into the Stonetalon Mountains. You come out in Windshear Crag. Kaela Shadowspear watches the valley from its south-west side (59.9, 66.8).
A 1085 | Kaela Shadowspear
T 1085 | Gaxim Rustfizzle, a few steps from her
A 1071 | Gaxim Rustfizzle
A 1093 | Ziz Fizziks, in the small hut a little north (59.0, 62.6)
C 1071,1093 | The Venture Co. camps fill Windshear Crag north-east of here. Kill 10 Loggers (18-19) and 10 Deforesters (19-20), and Operators (19-20, around the machines) until one drops the Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints.
A 1090 | Piznik stands at the back of the Windshear Mine, the kobold mine in the south-east wall of the crag (71.9, 60.0). Kill the Windshear kobolds (20-22) on the way in.
C 1090 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 71.9, 60.0 | Piznik starts mining and kobolds attack in waves until he is done. Start at full health. Stand at the tunnel in front of him and send the Voidwalker at each wave so the kobolds stay off him; you cannot heal him. Kill each wave one kobold at a time, and use Health Funnel on the Voidwalker and bandage or eat between waves. He must survive.
T 1090 | Piznik
A 1092 | Piznik
T 1092,1093 | Ziz Fizziks. Do not take Further Instructions (it sends you to Ratchet).
T 1071 | Gaxim Rustfizzle. Do not take An Old Colleague (it sends you to Ironforge and Stormwind).

# ---------- Mirkfallon Lake and Stonetalon Peak ----------
A 86574 | Follow the road west and then north through the mountains to Mirkfallon Lake. On the way it passes below Sun Rock Retreat, a Horde town (Classic knowledge): stay on the road and do not go up the side path. The body of the Night Elf Courier lies at the lake (48.6, 39.8): Stonetalon Supply Run (new in Forever).
C 86574,1134 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 50.6, 43.0 | Pridewing wyverns fly all around Mirkfallon Lake: Wyverns (21-22), Consorts (22-23) and Skyhunters (23-24). Kill them for 12 Pridewing Venom Sacs and 6 Stonetalon Supply Bundles (the new quest's bundles come from the same wyverns). They poison you and a warlock cannot cure poison: let the Voidwalker hold them, use Drain Life in the fight, and bandage and eat between fights. Leave the Pridewing Patriarch (25, rare elite) alone.
T 86574 | Take the road north from the lake up to Stonetalon Peak. Innkeeper Faralia is in the inn (35.7, 5.8).
T 1056 | Keeper Albagorm, the big Keeper of the Grove on the hill (37.1, 8.1). Do not take his follow-up.
F Stonetalon Peak @ Stonetalon Mountains, 36.4, 7.2 | Teloren, the hippogryph master

# ---------- Back to Astranaar and the boat ----------
FLY Astranaar | Teloren. If the flight is not offered, use your hearthstone: it is bound in Astranaar.
T 1134 | Shindrell Swiftfire
T 1025 | Raene Wolfrunner
T 1034 | Pelturas Whitemoon
T 98027 | Maliynn, in the building next to Raene (36.6, 49.9). Press Skip if you never picked up the pendant.
FLY Auberdine | Daelyshia, at the west entrance of Astranaar
N Take the boat from Auberdine to Menethil Harbor | Check on the dock which boat it is: one pier goes to Menethil Harbor, the other to Darnassus. Raene's Cleansing stays in your log.
